**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# Excluded to keep it out of the image, and because `az acr build` dies packing the
# source tar when it cannot read it: "[WinError 5] Access is denied: '.\.pytest_cache'".
# pytest leaves directories here that the CLI has no rights to open, and the failure
# looked like a successful deploy — the build never queued, the previous image rolled
# out instead, and the version on the VM did not change.
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.git
.nsdeploy
cailville
docs
tests
nsdeploy_service/tests
nsdeploy_service/nsdeploy_service.egg-info
*.egg-info
build/
dist/
venv/
.venv/
**/node_modules/
# No credentials in the build context. The Dockerfile does not copy .env any more, so
# no key stays in an image layer. The service reads its settings from container env
# vars, or from a file named by NSDEPLOY_SERVICE_ENV_FILE on a mounted volume.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.DS_Store
.idea/
